	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Set point: SUM -> CLAMP (limited by the ceiling node from CMT and BACK-OFF) -> NOT_TOTAL.\nOverstroke: HOG -> TRIP -> COUNTER -> BACK-OFF (BACK_OFF_COUNT, and the ceiling node).\nSignal roles are inferred (analysis/OVERSTROKE.md 2.3); the patent text does not describe FIG 5C."
